{"id":"cbd8e35070d95035","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits.md","title":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits","display":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits","aliases":["14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits"],"display":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits","depends_on":["[[14-df-small-category]]","[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"898681611f432286\" href=\"?note=898681611f432286\" title=\"14-df-small-category\">14-df-small-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5f5c83c7517a2504\" href=\"?note=5f5c83c7517a2504\" title=\"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification\">14-thm-double-plus-sheafification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 为小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,\\eta\">\\(a,\\eta\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4123133f8910827a\" href=\"?note=4123133f8910827a\" title=\"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit\">14-df-sheafification-functor-unit</a>）。极限见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55bd5d1a324171ab\" href=\"?note=55bd5d1a324171ab\" title=\"14-df-limits-colimits\">14-df-limits-colimits</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall K,D,L,\\pi\\ \\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(K)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(K)|,|\\mathrm{Mor}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}(a(L),(a(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall K,D,L,\\pi\\ \\bigl(&amp;\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(K)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(K)|,|\\mathrm{Mor}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}(a(L),(a(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.5 Theorem 1 及其证明末段，印刷页 128、133–134；DjVu 第 70、72–73 图页。plus 构造的有限组代表可在共同覆盖筛上细化：积的有限组相容族由覆盖筛有限交统一，等化条件也可在进一步覆盖上统一；由此 plus 保终对象、二元积和等化子，双 plus 同样保持。任意层化函子与双 plus 自然同构，故结论与选择无关。旧陈述仅假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 为任意函子，常空集函子即为反例，现加入真正层化数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-small-category","status":"resolved","id":"898681611f432286","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-small-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-limits-colimits]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-double-plus-sheafification","status":"resolved","id":"5f5c83c7517a2504","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-double-plus-sheafification]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-sheafification-functor-unit","status":"resolved","id":"4123133f8910827a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$a,\\eta$ 满足 $\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$（[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]）。极限见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-limits-colimits","status":"resolved","id":"55bd5d1a324171ab","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 为小站点，$a,\\eta$ 满足 $\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)$（[[14-df-sheafification-functor-unit]]）。极限见 [[14-df-limits-colimits]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"a,\\eta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsSheafificationFunctor}(a,\\eta,\\mathcal C,J)\\to\\forall K,D,L,\\pi\\ \\bigl(&\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(K)\\land|\\mathrm{Ob}(K)|,|\\mathrm{Mor}(K)|\\in\\mathbb N\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{IsFunctor}(D,K,\\widehat{\\mathcal C})\\land\\mathrm{IsLimit}(L,\\pi,D)\\\\\n&\\to\\mathrm{IsLimit}(a(L),(a(\\pi_k))_{k\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(K)},a\\circ D)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":1689,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits|Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits]]"},{"id":"3a8105e59309bc16","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheafification-preserves-finite-limits|Theorem — Sheafification Preserves Finite Limits]]"},{"id":"e9091f671971bda5","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["898681611f432286","4123133f8910827a","55bd5d1a324171ab","5f5c83c7517a2504"]}